config LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_212_VELA_EDGE
	bool "Contest 2026 team 212 VelaMesh edge node (XIAO ESP32S3 Sense)"
	default n
	---help---
		Enable the VelaMesh (枢络) edge slave-node application.

		Runs the perception pipeline on XIAO ESP32S3 Sense:
		OV2640/OV3660 camera DMA capture, gait silhouette pre-filter,
		MobileFaceNet embedding over TFLite Micro, BLE passive proximity
		scan, and WiFi/MQTT uplink to the R528 hub node.

		Stage 1 builds a stub main loop; the ported module sources under
		modules/ are wired in by follow-up tasks behind their feature
		Kconfig options (TFLITEMICRO / ESP32S3 WiFi / BLE).
